Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:39.89,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:42.12,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:44.94,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:47.11,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:52.11,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:56.31,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.07,0:01:01.44,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.87,0:01:01.08,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:05.71,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.53,0:01:04.90,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
