Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.93,0:01:06.73,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.96,0:01:11.09,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.07,0:01:10.39,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:11.04,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:12.28,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:16.80,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.14,0:01:20.22,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:22.10,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
